{% if has('folder_overview') %}
{{ tool('folder_overview') }} requires collection. dataset optionally selects one dataset.
This call reads all dataset storage counts within one collection.
```json
{"collection":"alpha"}
```
This call selects one dataset.
```json
{"collection":"alpha","dataset":"files"}
```
{% endif %}
{% if has('folder_list') %}
{{ tool('folder_list') }} requires collection and dataset. node_id optionally selects a returned folder node.
Omit node_id to read the dataset root. Copy child node identifiers into later calls.
```json
{"collection":"alpha","dataset":"files"}
```
```json
{"collection":"alpha","dataset":"files","node_id":"COPY_RETURNED_NODE_ID"}
```
{% endif %}
{% if has('folder_search') %}
{{ tool('folder_search') }} requires collection, dataset and query. node_id optionally limits the search to one folder.
```json
{"collection":"alpha","dataset":"files","query":"report"}
```
```json
{"collection":"alpha","dataset":"files","query":"report","node_id":"COPY_RETURNED_NODE_ID"}
```
{% endif %}
{% if has('search_histogram') %}
{{ tool('search_histogram') }} accepts the same filters as search_collections, except sort and queries.
field is date, mentioned_date or size. It defaults to date. query defaults to an empty query.
Omitted collection covers every permitted collection. The result returns buckets and the selected field.
```json
{}
```
```json
{"collection":["alpha","beta"],"field":"size","query":"report","size_min":1024,"facet_filters":{"file_types":["pdf"]}}
```
{% endif %}
